Package: EasySILAC
Type: Package
Title: SILAC Protein Turnover Analysis with R and Rust Fitting Engines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Yunhui Kong", role =c("aut","cre"),email = "kongyunhui1@gamil.com")
      )
Author: Yunhui Kong [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yunhui Kong <kongyunhui1@gamil.com>
Description: Fitting (steady-state and non-steady-state), global
    labeling-efficiency (Hill) correction, quality control and visualization
    for pulsed SILAC proteomics data. Fitting is available in a pure-R
    implementation and a numerically identical, much faster Rust
    implementation (compiled on demand via rextendr).
